  "body": "From https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focusing-steps\r\n> The focusing steps for an object new focus target that is either a [focusable area](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focusable-area), or an element that is not a [focusable area](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focusable-area), or a [browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#browsing-context), are as follows.\r\n\r\nThen step 2 right below:\r\n> If new focus target is null, then:\r\n\r\nI would expect the initial text about \"focusing steps\" to list null as one of the possible values for \"new focus target\".",
